 and an ancestral mystery. Using vintage objects, photographs and ephemera, the narrator takes us on a poignant quest, from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pa3Uci93dxsQ7kNvwFKrQ3M&_nc_oc=AdnKrl_mDL0yiyPSQ8li4D0Iy_m6iWFxXxChATx2i1JGRNkUiNyrz3OjZMgOsq5Xzvc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwErZYAq2JZWajdCoilhCBE3NXdaa2RCstpSbvcN6n5rQ&oe=69AAB801"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hlaqhSLyktoQ7kNvwFqrYji&_nc_oc=Adlroog0UHv3ztH3bz1rZbN75uhQIFWdXwJg-KHTv0GAJfyIPuVNUrGVH7zlJExfID4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwgfxbH_ia6F_ep0eTNIofXFgr9g4vLxZ0g21n1O8JAOA&oe=69AAC566"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m5knUFRrOhEQ7kNvwFCs1zX&_nc_oc=AdmgWgCUVXwrfDWdTshjV8OAb3qmm5E3DrdOt9cSiAiXjujxqHXgA9Mr6VXTt-P3QPM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=sconte